<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="kk">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
<title>Түсетін дене · 1Б станциясы</title>
<style>
:root{color-scheme:light dark;--glass:rgba(255,255,255,.9);--ink:#16202f;--mut:#4d5b75;--line:rgba(20,30,50,.16);--page:#0b1220;box-sizing:border-box;padding-top:env(safe-area-inset-top,0px);padding-bottom:env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)}
